**Hypothesis:**  
Merging a cannon from one column onto another column *before* the pirate in the source column has been hit at least once makes the level unwinnable, because the source column then has no cannon to damage its pirate and that pirate will reach position 3 unimpeded.

```json
{
  "predicted_outcome": "winnable",
  "levelNumber": 42,
  "password": "A1234",
  "isHard": false,
  "filas": [
    {
      "cuadros": [
        {"index": 0, "tipo": 1, "hp": 2},
        {"index": 1, "tipo": 4, "hp": 2}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Hypothesis:**  
A cannon placed on a column in the same round a pirate reaches position 2 can still fire before the pirate advances to position 3, allowing the player to kill the pirate at the last possible moment.

```json
{
  "predicted_outcome": "winnable",
  "levelNumber": 1,
  "password": "A0001",
  "isHard": false,
  "filas": [
    {
      "cuadros": [
        {"index": 0, "tipo": 1, "hp": 1},
        {"index": 1, "tipo": 1, "hp": 1}
      ]
    },
    {
      "cuadros": [
        {"index": 2, "tipo": 4, "hp": 1}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
